The targets of the API and of the driver are static libraries.
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
Copyright (C) 2026 Sergey Subbotin <ssubbotin@gmail.com>

libEGL, libGLESv2 and libgallium are shared_library targets in Mesa; the
loader of stafeto knows one shared library, the C library, so they become
static_library targets without their version scripts and sonames, and
tools/build-mesa.py merges the archives of the build into one.

